  "articles": [
    {
      "title": "共学 D5：假滑点到真实滑点，摩擦吃掉价差",
      "author": "Paxon Qiao",
      "digest": "第五天把滑点从纸面概念变成实测数字。SOL/USDC 毛池价差 10.5bps，完整环净收益恒负 19-34bps",
      "content": "<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\">\n<title>MoonPub Preview</title>\n</head>\n<body style=\"margin:0;background:#f6f7f9;padding:24px 12px;\">\n<main style=\"box-sizing: border-box; max-width: 720px; margin: 0 auto; background:#fff; padding:28px 24px; box-shadow:0 12px 36px rgba(15,23,42,0.08);\">\n<section style=\"font-family: -apple-system, 'PingFang SC', 'Hiragino Sans GB', 'Microsoft YaHei', sans-serif; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.9; letter-spacing: 0.05em; color: #333; background: #fff; padding: 0 4px;\">\n\n<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\"><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\"><title>Cover</title>\n<style>\n*{margin:0;padding:0;box-sizing:border-box}\nbody{width:900px;height:500px;overflow:hidden;font-family:'SF Pro Text',-apple-system,'PingFang SC','Hiragino Sans GB','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;background:#030712}\n.cover{width:900px;height:500px;position:relative;overflow:hidden;background:radial-gradient(circle at 78% 18%,rgba(34,197,94,.22),transparent 25%),linear-gradient(135deg,#020617 0%,#0b1020 48%,#111827 100%);color:#e5edf7;padding:64px 76px}\n.grid{position:absolute;inset:0;background-image:linear-gradient(rgba(148,163,184,.08) 1px,transparent 1px),linear-gradient(90deg,rgba(148,163,184,.08) 1px,transparent 1px);background-size:34px 34px;opacity:.65}\n.glow{position:absolute;right:74px;top:54px;width:220px;height:220px;border:1px solid rgba(34,197,94,.28);border-radius:50%;box-shadow:0 0 60px rgba(34,197,94,.16)}\n.panel{position:relative;height:100%;border:1px solid rgba(148,163,184,.22);border-radius:18px;background:rgba(2,6,23,.72);box-shadow:0 22px 55px rgba(0,0,0,.35);padding:38px 44px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;justify-content:center}\n.toolbar{position:absolute;top:20px;left:24px;display:flex;gap:8px}\n.dot{width:9px;height:9px;border-radius:50%;background:#22c55e;box-shadow:0 0 16px rgba(34,197,94,.8)}\n.dot:nth-child(2){background:#38bdf8;box-shadow:0 0 14px rgba(56,189,248,.7)}\n.dot:nth-child(3){background:#f59e0b;box-shadow:0 0 14px rgba(245,158,11,.65)}\n.tag{display:inline-block;color:#86efac;font-size:11px;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:4px;text-transform:uppercase;margin-bottom:24px}\n.prompt{color:#22c55e;margin-right:10px}\n.title{font-size:42px;font-weight:900;line-height:1.16;color:#f8fafc;max-width:640px;margin-bottom:18px;letter-spacing:.4px;text-shadow:0 0 24px rgba(34,197,94,.16)}\n.subtitle{font-size:16px;color:#a7b6c8;line-height:1.75;max-width:560px;margin-bottom:34px}\n.meta{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:14px;color:#94a3b8;font-size:13px}\n.chip{border:1px solid rgba(34,197,94,.32);border-radius:999px;padding:7px 13px;color:#bbf7d0;background:rgba(34,197,94,.08);font-family:'SF Mono',Consolas,monospace}\n.author{letter-spacing:1px}\n.scanline{position:absolute;left:0;right:0;bottom:62px;height:1px;background:linear-gradient(90deg,transparent,#22c55e,transparent);opacity:.75}\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<main class=\"cover\" data-cover-style=\"geek-black\">\n  <div class=\"grid\"></div><div class=\"glow\"></div>\n  <section class=\"panel\">\n    <div class=\"toolbar\"><span class=\"dot\"></span><span class=\"dot\"></span><span class=\"dot\"></span></div>\n    <div class=\"tag\"><span class=\"prompt\">$</span>BUILD NOTES</div>\n    <h1 class=\"title\">共学 D5：假滑点到真实滑点，摩擦吃掉价差</h1>\n    <p class=\"subtitle\">第五天把滑点从纸面概念变成实测数字。SOL/USDC 毛池价差 10.5bps，完整环净收益恒负 19-34bps，主流池跨 DEX 也被摩擦吃掉。真正有肉的是事件窗口，下架合约价差实测 439bps，OI 活跃度才是窗口信号。八哨兵矩阵同日上线。</p>\n    <div class=\"meta\"><span class=\"chip\">moonpub render</span><span class=\"author\">Paxon Qiao</span></div>\n    <div class=\"scanline\"></div>\n  </section>\n</main>\n</body>\n</html>\n<h2 style=\"font-size: 19px; font-weight: 800; color: #1a1a1a; margin: 2.3em 0 1em; padding: 0 0 10px 14px; border-left: 5px solid #2c2c2c; border-bottom: 1px solid #e5e7eb; letter-spacing: 1px; line-height:1.45;\">共学 D5：假滑点到真实滑点，摩擦吃掉价差</h2>\n\n<section style=\"margin: 1.9em 0; padding: 18px 20px 18px 24px; background: #f8f8f8; border: 1px solid #e5e7eb; border-left: 4px solid #2c2c2c; border-radius: 0 8px 8px 0; box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(15,23,42,0.05); color: #888; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.9; letter-spacing: 0.08em;\">链上套利残酷共学 · 第 5 天\n2026-08-09</section>\n\n<p style=\"margin: 0 0 1.55em; color: #555; font-size: 16px; line-height: 2.05; letter-spacing: 0.08em; word-spacing: 0.05em; text-align: justify;\">第五天继续干\"验证\"这件事。前一天把 CEX 跨所搬砖钉死了，这天轮到 Solana 跨 DEX。顺手把滑点这个一直被当概念用的词，换成了能算账的实测数字。</p>\n\n<p style=\"margin: 0 0 1.25em; color: #555; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.95; letter-spacing: 0.08em; word-spacing: 0.05em; text-align: justify; text-indent: 2em;\">结论先说，主流池的肉也被吃干净了。但同一天，群里的下架套利策略跑出了 439bps 的价差实证，还补齐了 8 个监控哨兵。这天最大的收获不是某个数字，是终于分清了哪里没肉、哪里肉还活着。</p>\n\n<section style=\"margin: 2.2em 0; text-align:center;\"><section style=\"display:inline-block;width:42px;height:2px;background:#e5e7eb;vertical-align:middle;\"></section><span style=\"display:inline-block;width:6px;height:6px;border:1px solid #2c2c2c;border-radius:50%;margin:0 10px;vertical-align:middle;background:#fff;\"></span><section style=\"display:inline-block;width:42px;height:2px;background:#e5e7eb;vertical-align:middle;\"></section></section>\n\n<h2 style=\"font-size: 19px; font-weight: 800; color: #1a1a1a; margin: 2.3em 0 1em; padding: 0 0 10px 14px; border-left: 5px solid #2c2c2c; border-bottom: 1px solid #e5e7eb; letter-spacing: 1px; line-height:1.45;\">一、从假滑点到真实滑点</h2>\n\n<p style=\"margin: 0 0 1.25em; color: #555; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.95; letter-spacing: 0.08em; word-spacing: 0.05em; text-align: justify; text-indent: 2em;\">之前看滑点，全靠 Jupiter API 报的 <code style=\"background:#f5f5f5;padding:2px 4px;border-radius:3px;font-size:14px;font-family:monospace;\">priceImpactPct</code> 字段。那天发现它不靠谱，数值非单调，金额越大报得越乱。所以自己写了验证脚本，只读，三档口径对照。</p>\n\n<section style=\"margin: 18px 0 22px; padding: 4px 0;\">\n<table cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" style=\"border-collapse:collapse;width:100%;\">\n<tr><td style=\"width:34px;padding:8px 0 8px 4px;vertical-align:top;text-align:center;background:#f3f4f6;\"><span style=\"display:inline-block;width:7px;height:7px;background:#2c2c2c;border-radius:50%;vertical-align:middle;\"></span></td><td style=\"padding:8px 12px 8px 4px;vertical-align:top;background:#f3f4f6;color:#555;font-size:15px;line-height:1.8;\">恒定乘积模拟，纯数学算滑点</td></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"width:34px;padding:8px 0 8px 4px;vertical-align:top;text-align:center;background:#fff;\"><span style=\"display:inline-block;width:7px;height:7px;background:#2c2c2c;border-radius:50%;vertical-align:middle;\"></span></td><td style=\"padding:8px 12px 8px 4px;vertical-align:top;background:#fff;color:#555;font-size:15px;line-height:1.8;\">Jupiter 真实路由，看聚合器实际怎么走</td></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"width:34px;padding:8px 0 8px 4px;vertical-align:top;text-align:center;background:#f3f4f6;\"><span style=\"display:inline-block;width:7px;height:7px;background:#2c2c2c;border-radius:50%;vertical-align:middle;\"></span></td><td style=\"padding:8px 12px 8px 4px;vertical-align:top;background:#f3f4f6;color:#555;font-size:15px;line-height:1.8;\">完整环，USDC 进 Raydium 买、Jupiter 卖，把来回的摩擦全算上</td></tr>\n</table></section>\n\n<p style=\"margin: 0 0 1.25em; color: #555; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.95; letter-spacing: 0.08em; word-spacing: 0.05em; text-align: justify; text-indent: 2em;\">实测 SOL/USDC，毛池价差只有约 10.5bps，看着像有肉。但完整环净收益恒负，19 到 34bps 的亏损，见下表。</p>\n\n<section style=\"margin:22px 0;padding:12px 14px;background:#f8f8f8;border:1px solid #e5e7eb;border-radius:10px;\">\n<section style=\"margin:0 0 12px;padding:12px 14px;background:#fff;border:1px solid #e5e7eb;border-radius:8px;\">\n<p style=\"margin:0 0 7px;font-size:14px;line-height:1.75;color:#555;\"><span style=\"display:block;margin:0 0 2px;color:#2c2c2c;font-size:12px;font-weight:bold;letter-spacing:0.08em;\">口径</span>毛池价差</p>\n<p style=\"margin:0 0 7px;font-size:14px;line-height:1.75;color:#555;\"><span style=\"display:block;margin:0 0 2px;color:#2c2c2c;font-size:12px;font-weight:bold;letter-spacing:0.08em;\">结果</span>~10.5 bps</p>\n</section>\n<section style=\"margin:0 0 12px;padding:12px 14px;background:#fff;border:1px solid #e5e7eb;border-radius:8px;\">\n<p style=\"margin:0 0 7px;font-size:14px;line-height:1.75;color:#555;\"><span style=\"display:block;margin:0 0 2px;color:#2c2c2c;font-size:12px;font-weight:bold;letter-spacing:0.08em;\">口径</span>完整环净收益（0.1 SOL）</p>\n<p style=\"margin:0 0 7px;font-size:14px;line-height:1.75;color:#555;\"><span style=\"display:block;margin:0 0 2px;color:#2c2c2c;font-size:12px;font-weight:bold;letter-spacing:0.08em;\">结果</span><strong style=\"color: #1a1a1a;\">-19 bps</strong></p>\n</section>\n<section style=\"margin:0 0 12px;padding:12px 14px;background:#fff;border:1px solid #e5e7eb;border-radius:8px;\">\n<p style=\"margin:0 0 7px;font-size:14px;line-height:1.75;color:#555;\"><span style=\"display:block;margin:0 0 2px;color:#2c2c2c;font-size:12px;font-weight:bold;letter-spacing:0.08em;\">口径</span>完整环净收益（100 SOL）</p>\n<p style=\"margin:0 0 7px;font-size:14px;line-height:1.75;color:#555;\"><span style=\"display:block;margin:0 0 2px;color:#2c2c2c;font-size:12px;font-weight:bold;letter-spacing:0.08em;\">结果</span><strong style=\"color: #1a1a1a;\">-34 bps</strong></p>\n</section>\n</section>\n\n<p style=\"margin: 0 0 1.25em; color: #555; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.95; letter-spacing: 0.08em; word-spacing: 0.05em; text-align: justify; text-indent: 2em;\">问题出在 Raydium 买腿的 0.3% 手续费，单腿 30bps 就超过毛价差。滑点还是非线性的，0.1 SOL 进场亏 19bps，加到 100 SOL 亏 34bps，越大的单越亏。</p>\n\n<section style=\"margin: 1.9em 0; padding: 18px 20px 18px 24px; background: #f8f8f8; border: 1px solid #e5e7eb; border-left: 4px solid #2c2c2c; border-radius: 0 8px 8px 0; box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(15,23,42,0.05); color: #888; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.9; letter-spacing: 0.08em;\">技术坑记录，Jupiter v1 的 <code style=\"background:#f5f5f5;padding:2px 4px;border-radius:3px;font-size:14px;font-family:monospace;\">priceImpactPct</code> 不可靠，要用 outAmount 和 inAmount 实算成交价，别信 impact 字段。</section>\n\n<p style=\"margin: 0 0 1.25em; color: #555; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.95; letter-spacing: 0.08em; word-spacing: 0.05em; text-align: justify; text-indent: 2em;\">这条结论和 CEX 跨所完全同构。主流标的的摩擦大于价差，是常态，不是特例。肉不在主流池里。</p>\n\n<section style=\"margin: 2.2em 0; text-align:center;\"><section style=\"display:inline-block;width:42px;height:2px;background:#e5e7eb;vertical-align:middle;\"></section><span style=\"display:inline-block;width:6px;height:6px;border:1px solid #2c2c2c;border-radius:50%;margin:0 10px;vertical-align:middle;background:#fff;\"></span><section style=\"display:inline-block;width:42px;height:2px;background:#e5e7eb;vertical-align:middle;\"></section></section>\n\n<h2 style=\"font-size: 19px; font-weight: 800; color: #1a1a1a; margin: 2.3em 0 1em; padding: 0 0 10px 14px; border-left: 5px solid #2c2c2c; border-bottom: 1px solid #e5e7eb; letter-spacing: 1px; line-height:1.45;\">二、肉在哪：事件窗口，实测 439bps</h2>\n\n<p style=\"margin: 0 0 1.25em; color: #555; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.95; letter-spacing: 0.08em; word-spacing: 0.05em; text-align: justify; text-indent: 2em;\">群里 Paxon 分享过一句话，币安下架合约价差能有几十个点，盯着 OI 猛干。第五天把它跑成数据。</p>\n\n<p style=\"margin: 0 0 1.25em; color: #555; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.95; letter-spacing: 0.08em; word-spacing: 0.05em; text-align: justify; text-indent: 2em;\">脚本 <code style=\"background:#f5f5f5;padding:2px 4px;border-radius:3px;font-size:14px;font-family:monospace;\">binance_delisting_review.py</code> 拉币安 fapi 和 spot 的 klines，对齐算价差，8 月 7 日结算批次 ACX、HFT 两个标的。</p>\n\n<section style=\"margin:22px 0;padding:12px 14px;background:#f8f8f8;border:1px solid #e5e7eb;border-radius:10px;\">\n<section style=\"margin:0 0 12px;padding:12px 14px;background:#fff;border:1px solid #e5e7eb;border-radius:8px;\">\n<p style=\"margin:0 0 7px;font-size:14px;line-height:1.75;color:#555;\"><span style=\"display:block;margin:0 0 2px;color:#2c2c2c;font-size:12px;font-weight:bold;letter-spacing:0.08em;\">标的</span>HFT</p>\n<p style=\"margin:0 0 7px;font-size:14px;line-height:1.75;color:#555;\"><span style=\"display:block;margin:0 0 2px;color:#2c2c2c;font-size:12px;font-weight:bold;letter-spacing:0.08em;\">价差峰值</span><strong style=\"color: #1a1a1a;\">439.2 bps（4.4%）</strong></p>\n<p style=\"margin:0 0 7px;font-size:14px;line-height:1.75;color:#555;\"><span style=\"display:block;margin:0 0 2px;color:#2c2c2c;font-size:12px;font-weight:bold;letter-spacing:0.08em;\">最后 6h 平均</span>226 bps</p>\n</section>\n<section style=\"margin:0 0 12px;padding:12px 14px;background:#fff;border:1px solid #e5e7eb;border-radius:8px;\">\n<p style=\"margin:0 0 7px;font-size:14px;line-height:1.75;color:#555;\"><span style=\"display:block;margin:0 0 2px;color:#2c2c2c;font-size:12px;font-weight:bold;letter-spacing:0.08em;\">标的</span>ACX</p>\n<p style=\"margin:0 0 7px;font-size:14px;line-height:1.75;color:#555;\"><span style=\"display:block;margin:0 0 2px;color:#2c2c2c;font-size:12px;font-weight:bold;letter-spacing:0.08em;\">价差峰值</span>122.7 bps</p>\n<p style=\"margin:0 0 7px;font-size:14px;line-height:1.75;color:#555;\"><span style=\"display:block;margin:0 0 2px;color:#2c2c2c;font-size:12px;font-weight:bold;letter-spacing:0.08em;\">最后 6h 平均</span>70.4 bps</p>\n</section>\n</section>\n\n<p style=\"margin: 0 0 1.25em; color: #555; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.95; letter-spacing: 0.08em; word-spacing: 0.05em; text-align: justify; text-indent: 2em;\">4 月批次补验，DENT 195.4、TRU 171.4、AI 153.8。群里说的\"几十个点\"是常态，不是个例。</p>\n\n<p style=\"margin: 0 0 1.25em; color: #555; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.95; letter-spacing: 0.08em; word-spacing: 0.05em; text-align: justify; text-indent: 2em;\">两个认知修正值得单独说。</p>\n\n<p style=\"margin: 0 0 1.25em; color: #555; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.95; letter-spacing: 0.08em; word-spacing: 0.05em; text-align: justify; text-indent: 2em;\"><strong style=\"color: #1a1a1a;\">OI 的绝对值方向不决定价差，OI 活跃度才是窗口信号。</strong> HFT 的 OI 暴涨 174.5%，投机潮，价差 439bps。ACX 的 OI 反而跌了 51.8%，提前离场，价差照样有 122.7bps。盯着 OI 猛干没错，但看的是偏离基线的活跃度，不是看涨看跌。</p>\n\n<p style=\"margin: 0 0 1.25em; color: #555; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.95; letter-spacing: 0.08em; word-spacing: 0.05em; text-align: justify; text-indent: 2em;\"><strong style=\"color: #1a1a1a;\">容量瓶颈在现货腿。</strong> 监控加了订单簿联动，SETTLING 信号出现时自动拉 fapi 和 spot 深度。实测现货侧深度只有合约侧的六分之一。价差是每单位的上限，深度决定能吃多少，容量卡在现货。</p>\n\n<p style=\"margin: 0 0 1.25em; color: #555; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.95; letter-spacing: 0.08em; word-spacing: 0.05em; text-align: justify; text-indent: 2em;\">风险也要记全。方向不总单边，ACX 出现过 49bps 的折价。盘口薄，进场冲击还没验证。下架监控已上线，每小时跑一次。</p>\n\n<section style=\"margin: 2.2em 0; text-align:center;\"><section style=\"display:inline-block;width:42px;height:2px;background:#e5e7eb;vertical-align:middle;\"></section><span style=\"display:inline-block;width:6px;height:6px;border:1px solid #2c2c2c;border-radius:50%;margin:0 10px;vertical-align:middle;background:#fff;\"></span><section style=\"display:inline-block;width:42px;height:2px;background:#e5e7eb;vertical-align:middle;\"></section></section>\n\n<h2 style=\"font-size: 19px; font-weight: 800; color: #1a1a1a; margin: 2.3em 0 1em; padding: 0 0 10px 14px; border-left: 5px solid #2c2c2c; border-bottom: 1px solid #e5e7eb; letter-spacing: 1px; line-height:1.45;\">三、工程日：8 个哨兵矩阵</h2>\n\n<p style=\"margin: 0 0 1.25em; color: #555; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.95; letter-spacing: 0.08em; word-spacing: 0.05em; text-align: justify; text-indent: 2em;\">第五天也是工程大日。基础设施自检哨兵第一次跑，就抓到两个真问题。</p>\n\n<section style=\"margin: 18px 0 22px; padding: 4px 0;\">\n<table cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" style=\"border-collapse:collapse;width:100%;\">\n<tr><td style=\"width:34px;padding:8px 0 8px 4px;vertical-align:top;text-align:center;background:#f3f4f6;\"><span style=\"display:inline-block;min-width:22px;height:22px;padding:0 4px;background:#2c2c2c;color:#fff;border-radius:999px;text-align:center;line-height:22px;font-size:12px;font-weight:bold;\">1</span></td><td style=\"padding:8px 12px 8px 4px;vertical-align:top;background:#f3f4f6;color:#555;font-size:15px;line-height:1.8;\">Jupiter v6 API 官方已下线，2025 年 10 月弃用的老接口，还在被脚本调用。修掉，顺手清了一个遗留 bug</td></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"width:34px;padding:8px 0 8px 4px;vertical-align:top;text-align:center;background:#fff;\"><span style=\"display:inline-block;min-width:22px;height:22px;padding:0 4px;background:#2c2c2c;color:#fff;border-radius:999px;text-align:center;line-height:22px;font-size:12px;font-weight:bold;\">2</span></td><td style=\"padding:8px 12px 8px 4px;vertical-align:top;background:#fff;color:#555;font-size:15px;line-height:1.8;\">defisphere 裸路径 404，必须带完整 query params</td></tr>\n</table></section>\n\n<p style=\"margin: 0 0 1.25em; color: #555; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.95; letter-spacing: 0.08em; word-spacing: 0.05em; text-align: justify; text-indent: 2em;\">这种静默失效，模拟盘根本看不出来，只能靠哨兵先发现。Solana 执行层一口气补了 5 个哨兵。</p>\n\n<section style=\"margin:22px 0;padding:12px 14px;background:#f8f8f8;border:1px solid #e5e7eb;border-radius:10px;\">\n<section style=\"margin:0 0 12px;padding:12px 14px;background:#fff;border:1px solid #e5e7eb;border-radius:8px;\">\n<p style=\"margin:0 0 7px;font-size:14px;line-height:1.75;color:#555;\"><span style=\"display:block;margin:0 0 2px;color:#2c2c2c;font-size:12px;font-weight:bold;letter-spacing:0.08em;\">哨兵</span>priority fee 竞价</p>\n<p style=\"margin:0 0 7px;font-size:14px;line-height:1.75;color:#555;\"><span style=\"display:block;margin:0 0 2px;color:#2c2c2c;font-size:12px;font-weight:bold;letter-spacing:0.08em;\">首跑发现</span>150 区块全部 0，周末凌晨无竞争，正常市场执行成本等于 0</p>\n</section>\n<section style=\"margin:0 0 12px;padding:12px 14px;background:#fff;border:1px solid #e5e7eb;border-radius:8px;\">\n<p style=\"margin:0 0 7px;font-size:14px;line-height:1.75;color:#555;\"><span style=\"display:block;margin:0 0 2px;color:#2c2c2c;font-size:12px;font-weight:bold;letter-spacing:0.08em;\">哨兵</span>Jito bundle</p>\n<p style=\"margin:0 0 7px;font-size:14px;line-height:1.75;color:#555;\"><span style=\"display:block;margin:0 0 2px;color:#2c2c2c;font-size:12px;font-weight:bold;letter-spacing:0.08em;\">首跑发现</span>P99 tip 2.02M lamports，100% 带 tip，套利竞争全走 Jito 不走 priority fee</p>\n</section>\n<section style=\"margin:0 0 12px;padding:12px 14px;background:#fff;border:1px solid #e5e7eb;border-radius:8px;\">\n<p style=\"margin:0 0 7px;font-size:14px;line-height:1.75;color:#555;\"><span style=\"display:block;margin:0 0 2px;color:#2c2c2c;font-size:12px;font-weight:bold;letter-spacing:0.08em;\">哨兵</span>Drift 链上 funding</p>\n<p style=\"margin:0 0 7px;font-size:14px;line-height:1.75;color:#555;\"><span style=\"display:block;margin:0 0 2px;color:#2c2c2c;font-size:12px;font-weight:bold;letter-spacing:0.08em;\">首跑发现</span>BTC -16.14%/24h，链上空头极端拥挤，与 CEX 冷静对照</p>\n</section>\n<section style=\"margin:0 0 12px;padding:12px 14px;background:#fff;border:1px solid #e5e7eb;border-radius:8px;\">\n<p style=\"margin:0 0 7px;font-size:14px;line-height:1.75;color:#555;\"><span style=\"display:block;margin:0 0 2px;color:#2c2c2c;font-size:12px;font-weight:bold;letter-spacing:0.08em;\">哨兵</span>失败交易</p>\n<p style=\"margin:0 0 7px;font-size:14px;line-height:1.75;color:#555;\"><span style=\"display:block;margin:0 0 2px;color:#2c2c2c;font-size:12px;font-weight:bold;letter-spacing:0.08em;\">首跑发现</span>Raydium-CP 60% 失败率，Pump.fun 73%，执行质量基线</p>\n</section>\n<section style=\"margin:0 0 12px;padding:12px 14px;background:#fff;border:1px solid #e5e7eb;border-radius:8px;\">\n<p style=\"margin:0 0 7px;font-size:14px;line-height:1.75;color:#555;\"><span style=\"display:block;margin:0 0 2px;color:#2c2c2c;font-size:12px;font-weight:bold;letter-spacing:0.08em;\">哨兵</span>Jupiter 路由</p>\n<p style=\"margin:0 0 7px;font-size:14px;line-height:1.75;color:#555;\"><span style=\"display:block;margin:0 0 2px;color:#2c2c2c;font-size:12px;font-weight:bold;letter-spacing:0.08em;\">首跑发现</span>秒级跳变是常态，连续 2 次一致才算稳定变化</p>\n</section>\n</section>\n\n<p style=\"margin: 0 0 1.25em; color: #555; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.95; letter-spacing: 0.08em; word-spacing: 0.05em; text-align: justify; text-indent: 2em;\">funding 哨兵也升级到 v2，加了 basis 分位维度，还内置了\"疑似诱盘\"检测，跨所 funding 差超过 0.5% 一期就标红。TUT 狗庄诱盘那种局，以后自动报。</p>\n\n<section style=\"margin: 2.2em 0; text-align:center;\"><section style=\"display:inline-block;width:42px;height:2px;background:#e5e7eb;vertical-align:middle;\"></section><span style=\"display:inline-block;width:6px;height:6px;border:1px solid #2c2c2c;border-radius:50%;margin:0 10px;vertical-align:middle;background:#fff;\"></span><section style=\"display:inline-block;width:42px;height:2px;background:#e5e7eb;vertical-align:middle;\"></section></section>\n\n<h2 style=\"font-size: 19px; font-weight: 800; color: #1a1a1a; margin: 2.3em 0 1em; padding: 0 0 10px 14px; border-left: 5px solid #2c2c2c; border-bottom: 1px solid #e5e7eb; letter-spacing: 1px; line-height:1.45;\">四、风控永远是第一课</h2>\n\n<p style=\"margin: 0 0 1.25em; color: #555; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.95; letter-spacing: 0.08em; word-spacing: 0.05em; text-align: justify; text-indent: 2em;\">数据越多，越要对风险保持敬畏。第五天把几条风险结论沉淀成了笔记。</p>\n\n<p style=\"margin: 0 0 1.25em; color: #555; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.95; letter-spacing: 0.08em; word-spacing: 0.05em; text-align: justify; text-indent: 2em;\"><strong style=\"color: #1a1a1a;\">期现套利成本模型，主流币 12 个组合全部为负。</strong> 空间等于价差减 funding 减手续费减滑点，主流币普遍负 27 到 32bps。看着是搬砖，实则是给交易所送手续费。</p>\n\n<p style=\"margin: 0 0 1.25em; color: #555; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.95; letter-spacing: 0.08em; word-spacing: 0.05em; text-align: justify; text-indent: 2em;\"><strong style=\"color: #1a1a1a;\">隐藏爆仓机制。</strong> 1 倍杠杆的统一账户也会爆，funding、全仓保证金、价差背离都会触发。振幅过滤是双刃剑，过滤了插针也过滤了真机会。这条教训来自一次真实的爆仓复盘。</p>\n\n<p style=\"margin: 0 0 1.25em; color: #555; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.95; letter-spacing: 0.08em; word-spacing: 0.05em; text-align: justify; text-indent: 2em;\"><strong style=\"color: #1a1a1a;\">持续性检测，防快照假象。</strong> 长尾币测试里，GOAT 的 54% 价差占比是真信号，MEW 的 17% 是快照假象，被过滤掉了。看到一个大价差先问一句，它持续了多久。</p>\n\n<p style=\"margin: 0 0 1.25em; color: #555; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.95; letter-spacing: 0.08em; word-spacing: 0.05em; text-align: justify; text-indent: 2em;\">BitMart 的第一桶金也归档了。1000u 到 8w 的 alpha 是充值时间差，知道确定性卖压时刻，提前埋伏。它和下架套利同构，都是确定性失衡时刻，都是提前进场等别人。</p>\n\n<p style=\"margin: 0 0 1.25em; color: #555; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.95; letter-spacing: 0.08em; word-spacing: 0.05em; text-align: justify; text-indent: 2em;\">套利是概率游戏。黑天鹅无处不在，敞口控制优先于机会挖掘，这是风控总纲的第一条。</p>\n\n<section style=\"margin: 2.2em 0; text-align:center;\"><section style=\"display:inline-block;width:42px;height:2px;background:#e5e7eb;vertical-align:middle;\"></section><span style=\"display:inline-block;width:6px;height:6px;border:1px solid #2c2c2c;border-radius:50%;margin:0 10px;vertical-align:middle;background:#fff;\"></span><section style=\"display:inline-block;width:42px;height:2px;background:#e5e7eb;vertical-align:middle;\"></section></section>\n\n<h2 style=\"font-size: 19px; font-weight: 800; color: #1a1a1a; margin: 2.3em 0 1em; padding: 0 0 10px 14px; border-left: 5px solid #2c2c2c; border-bottom: 1px solid #e5e7eb; letter-spacing: 1px; line-height:1.45;\">五、方法论沉淀</h2>\n\n<section style=\"margin: 18px 0 22px; padding: 4px 0;\">\n<table cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" style=\"border-collapse:collapse;width:100%;\">\n<tr><td style=\"width:34px;padding:8px 0 8px 4px;vertical-align:top;text-align:center;background:#f3f4f6;\"><span style=\"display:inline-block;min-width:22px;height:22px;padding:0 4px;background:#2c2c2c;color:#fff;border-radius:999px;text-align:center;line-height:22px;font-size:12px;font-weight:bold;\">1</span></td><td style=\"padding:8px 12px 8px 4px;vertical-align:top;background:#f3f4f6;color:#555;font-size:15px;line-height:1.8;\">主流标的摩擦大于价差，CEX 跨所和 Solana 跨 DEX 都是，机会在长尾和事件驱动</td></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"width:34px;padding:8px 0 8px 4px;vertical-align:top;text-align:center;background:#fff;\"><span style=\"display:inline-block;min-width:22px;height:22px;padding:0 4px;background:#2c2c2c;color:#fff;border-radius:999px;text-align:center;line-height:22px;font-size:12px;font-weight:bold;\">2</span></td><td style=\"padding:8px 12px 8px 4px;vertical-align:top;background:#fff;color:#555;font-size:15px;line-height:1.8;\">盲套利不是算得更快，是换了个算的位置。链下算重、链上验轻是主流形态</td></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"width:34px;padding:8px 0 8px 4px;vertical-align:top;text-align:center;background:#f3f4f6;\"><span style=\"display:inline-block;min-width:22px;height:22px;padding:0 4px;background:#2c2c2c;color:#fff;border-radius:999px;text-align:center;line-height:22px;font-size:12px;font-weight:bold;\">3</span></td><td style=\"padding:8px 12px 8px 4px;vertical-align:top;background:#f3f4f6;color:#555;font-size:15px;line-height:1.8;\">滑点要用成交价实算，不能信 API 的 impact 字段</td></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"width:34px;padding:8px 0 8px 4px;vertical-align:top;text-align:center;background:#fff;\"><span style=\"display:inline-block;min-width:22px;height:22px;padding:0 4px;background:#2c2c2c;color:#fff;border-radius:999px;text-align:center;line-height:22px;font-size:12px;font-weight:bold;\">4</span></td><td style=\"padding:8px 12px 8px 4px;vertical-align:top;background:#fff;color:#555;font-size:15px;line-height:1.8;\">OI 活跃度才是窗口信号，绝对值方向不决定价差</td></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"width:34px;padding:8px 0 8px 4px;vertical-align:top;text-align:center;background:#f3f4f6;\"><span style=\"display:inline-block;min-width:22px;height:22px;padding:0 4px;background:#2c2c2c;color:#fff;border-radius:999px;text-align:center;line-height:22px;font-size:12px;font-weight:bold;\">5</span></td><td style=\"padding:8px 12px 8px 4px;vertical-align:top;background:#f3f4f6;color:#555;font-size:15px;line-height:1.8;\">不敢上仓位是正确状态。哨兵先发现数据源静默失效，人再决定动不动手</td></tr>\n</table></section>\n\n<h2 style=\"font-size: 19px; font-weight: 800; color: #1a1a1a; margin: 2.3em 0 1em; padding: 0 0 10px 14px; border-left: 5px solid #2c2c2c; border-bottom: 1px solid #e5e7eb; letter-spacing: 1px; line-height:1.45;\">明天做什么</h2>\n\n<section style=\"margin: 18px 0 22px; padding: 4px 0;\">\n<table cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" style=\"border-collapse:collapse;width:100%;\">\n<tr><td style=\"width:34px;padding:8px 0 8px 4px;vertical-align:top;text-align:center;background:#f3f4f6;\"><span style=\"display:inline-block;min-width:22px;height:22px;padding:0 4px;background:#2c2c2c;color:#fff;border-radius:999px;text-align:center;line-height:22px;font-size:12px;font-weight:bold;\">1</span></td><td style=\"padding:8px 12px 8px 4px;vertical-align:top;background:#f3f4f6;color:#555;font-size:15px;line-height:1.8;\">TUT 价差窗口回测，下载币安和 bitget 历史数据，验证价差加爆仓量两因子能不能预判窗口期</td></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"width:34px;padding:8px 0 8px 4px;vertical-align:top;text-align:center;background:#fff;\"><span style=\"display:inline-block;min-width:22px;height:22px;padding:0 4px;background:#2c2c2c;color:#fff;border-radius:999px;text-align:center;line-height:22px;font-size:12px;font-weight:bold;\">2</span></td><td style=\"padding:8px 12px 8px 4px;vertical-align:top;background:#fff;color:#555;font-size:15px;line-height:1.8;\">basis 分位攒够历史后校准阈值，0.8 是否合理要数据说话</td></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"width:34px;padding:8px 0 8px 4px;vertical-align:top;text-align:center;background:#f3f4f6;\"><span style=\"display:inline-block;min-width:22px;height:22px;padding:0 4px;background:#2c2c2c;color:#fff;border-radius:999px;text-align:center;line-height:22px;font-size:12px;font-weight:bold;\">3</span></td><td style=\"padding:8px 12px 8px 4px;vertical-align:top;background:#f3f4f6;color:#555;font-size:15px;line-height:1.8;\">插针价差窗口监控，多所价差超过 5% 自动记录触发时间、幅度、OI、盘口</td></tr>\n</table></section>\n\n\n\n<section style=\"margin-top:3em;padding-top:2em;border-top:1px solid #e8e8e8;\">\n\n<p style=\"margin:1em 0;color:#888;font-size:15px;text-align:center;\">— · —</p>\n\n<p style=\"margin:0.6em 0;color:#2c2c2c;font-size:15px;text-align:center;font-weight:bold;\">寻月隐君</p>\n\n<p style=\"margin:0.6em 0;color:#888;font-size:14px;text-align:center;line-height:1.8;\">专注 Web3、Python、Go、Rust 技术分享，探索区块链、智能合约、DApp 等前沿内容。<br>\n技术的光，未来的道。</p>\n\n<p style=\"margin:1em 0 0.4em;color:#888;font-size:13px;text-align:left;line-height:1.8;\">本文为个人学习记录，不构成投资建议。链上套利有风险，请自行评估。</p>\n\n<p style=\"margin:1.2em 0 0.6em;color:#888;font-size:13px;text-align:center;\">扫码加入「寻月阁」共学群</p>\n\n<p style=\"text-align:center;margin:1.5em 0 0.8em;\"><img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/22kVflKPKawjZg0sgmmNypdmJ1XKstq3OLjaHwlZG3O7LbpxHTAdBVRLtOwqlpS90ZicXAib2iaauxpIicHAhGOicVogbY0RrZ6IqPBib4UricZKMI/0?wx_fmt=jpeg&from=appmsg\" style=\"display:block;margin:0 auto;max-width:80%;width:240px;height:auto;\" alt=\"群二维码\"></p>\n\n<p style=\"text-align:center;margin:1.5em 0 0.8em;\"><img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/22kVflKPKazDemGiaNbBqUK3BEsKn547WWsawU4j82gUVgsianx1nAXJCzujCvCPnImAxA1Zqm5btoibaKOsJGcCfw16jqUNlU6bibNLszD8ntQ/0?wx_fmt=jpeg&from=appmsg\" style=\"max-width:100%;\" alt=\"关注\"></p>\n\n<p style=\"margin:0.8em 0;color:#888;font-size:13px;text-align:center;\">关注《寻月隐君》，一起在技术的星空下寻找属于自己的明月。</p>\n\n</section>\n\n\n</section>\n\n</main>\n</body>\n</html>\n"
